  "description": "Hybrid (lexical + vector) retrieval for SharpCoreDB: runs the BM25 lexical leg and the vector leg and fuses them by rank with reciprocal-rank fusion. Pure managed C# 15 / .NET 11.",
  "iconFile": "SharpCoreDB.jpg",
  "id": "SharpCoreDB.HybridSearch",
